						Ob, Jon, Nah, Hab, Zeph, Hag, Sach, Mal, Is,
						Jr, Bar, Lam, EpistJer, Hes, Sus, Dn, Bel; Mt,
						Mk, Lk, Jn, Act, Rom, 1Cor, 2Cor, Gal, Eph,
						Phil, Col, 1Th, 2Th, 1Tim, 2Tim, Tt, Phm, Heb,
						Jak, 1P, 2P, 1Jn, 2Jn, 3Jn, Jud, Rev.</p>
            </cRefPattern>
